WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
The takeaway is refreshingly simple.

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:07.550
You do not need a three-billion-parameter model and
hundreds of billions of tokens to

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:10.324
build a capable autoregressive vision model.

00:00:10.404 --> 00:00:11.900
Two classical techniques,

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:18.458
data augmentation to rebalance long-tailed tasks
and knowledge distillation to compress a large teacher,

00:00:18.538 --> 00:00:24.070
together let compact models trained on limited data
perform strongly across segmentation,

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.024
pose estimation, and deraining.

00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:31.447
That an eighty-million-parameter version even
reaches eighty-three percent accuracy on

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:33.528
ImageNet points toward efficient,

00:00:33.608 --> 00:00:38.320
deployable generalist vision models that unify
generation and understanding.
